BAG-Piglet reference implementations
=====================================

This directory contains four self-contained C11 reference implementations:

- bag_piglet128
- bag_piglet256
- bag_piglet384
- bag_piglet512

Each directory carries its own parameter definitions, scheme sources, FFI,
bundled RBC arithmetic, official API support files, and official KAT adapter.
No instance links source files from another security level.

Enter an instance directory and run:

    make

The default target builds only the official KAT executable. For example:

    cd bag_piglet128
    make kat
    ./build/bin/bag_piglet128-kat

The generated vector is written below the instance directory:

    output/KAT_KEM_bag_piglet_128.txt

Local functional and benchmark sources may exist in a developer checkout, but
they are intentionally excluded from the remote repository. See the root
README.md and each instance README for build details and file boundaries.
